{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FUkStwMPDfBsybpCpoxH4w","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Portfolio Program â€” Description (frozen design / North Star)\n2\t\n3\t## North Star (LOCKED)\n4\tBuild a deep, self-improving skill repository in Skill Foundry â€” model-agnostic cognitive skills,\n5\tcompositional recipes, and (later) stateful agents â€” where every skill carries a LOCKED North Star, journals\n6\tits own real-use experience, and is improved during \"sleep\" sessions WITHOUT drifting from its designed\n7\tpurpose. First end-to-end proof: a recreate-a-paper recipe that REPRODUCES the Gelman ANOVA paper, GRADED ON\n8\tARCHITECTURE/HANDOFF SUCCESS (not reproduction fidelity).\n9\t\n10\t## What this build delivers\n11\t1. **Shared infrastructure** (Waves 1â€“6): a deterministic-gate eval harness on the Foreman test substrate\n12\t   (three TAP-emitting validators; advisory cross-family/LLM judging isolated OUT of the gate path); a\n13\t   machine-checkable handoff contract; per-skill repo templates + a swappable logical-tierâ†’model table; the\n14\t   7-field journal schema + a North-Star-gated sleep loop with versioned rollback; Foundry governance wiring.\n15\t2. **Five cognitive skills to a concrete done-floor** (Waves 7â€“12): Gandalf (critical review), Ramanujan\n16\t   (math/algorithm), literature review, data analysis, analytic+ML code, code verification.\n17\t3. **The proof** (Waves 13â€“14): a recreate-a-paper recipe reproducing Gelman ANOVA, graded PASS/FAIL on a\n18\t   deterministic architecture/handoff done-check (NOT reproduction fidelity).\n19\t4. **The self-improving proof** (Wave 15): an inject-defect-then-recover demonstration that a skill measurably\n20\t   improves from its own genuine-execution journal across a sleep cycle.\n21\t\n22\t## Locked design pillars\n23\t- Two-tier repo: append-only journal vs curated SKILL.md; eval-gated, versioned, rollback-able promotion.\n24\t- PRINCIPLE-D: the no-regression GATE is deterministic-only; all LLM/cross-family judging is advisory and\n25\t  isolated from the (terminal) Foreman gate.\n26\t- North-Star anti-drift gate: non-goals are machine-checkable negative canaries; a revision advancing a\n27\t  non-goal is rejected.\n28\t- Persona = method + LOGICAL model tier (a swappable brain seam), so a different brain can be swapped in later.\n29\t- Machine-checkable handoff contract (north-star round-trip + existence-checked paths + block-on-open-questions).\n30\t- recreate-a-paper: required upstream lineage/lit-review + Assumptions Ledger + understandâ†’build firewall +\n31\t  executed numbers BOUND to the verified module + context-isolated advisory grader.\n32\t\n33\t## Out of scope (anti-drift)\n34\tGWL harness / t2rs brain (parallel track); stateful productivity/personal agents (later program phases); the\n35\textend-own-paper second slice; Jumper/doc-writing/legal/propose-extensions (later portfolio waves).\n36\t\n37\t## Provenance\n38\tForged by researchPrime (ENGINE-verified Phase-0 research) â†’ Crucible (Stage 0 lock â†’ Stage 1 Master Plan v4,\n39\t3 Shark-Tank rounds to convergence â†’ Stage 2). See `crucible/MASTER-PLAN.md`, `CRUCIBLE-INTAKE.md`,\n40\t`research/phase0-run/DELIVERABLE.md`.\n41\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"63322f7c-eeca-4ca2-a012-71bc44c711cb","uuid":"7c7b8f75-f1ea-4ca4-966b-d4508b528c6d","timestamp":"2026-06-23T00:48:28.994Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\Skill Foundry\\planning\\portfolio-program\\DESCRIPTION.md","content":"# Portfolio Program â€” Description (frozen design / North Star)\n\n## North Star (LOCKED)\nBuild a deep, self-improving skill repository in Skill Foundry â€” model-agnostic cognitive skills,\ncompositional recipes, and (later) stateful agents â€” where every skill carries a LOCKED North Star, journals\nits own real-use experience, and is improved during \"sleep\" sessions WITHOUT drifting from its designed\npurpose. First end-to-end proof: a recreate-a-paper recipe that REPRODUCES the Gelman ANOVA paper, GRADED ON\nARCHITECTURE/HANDOFF SUCCESS (not reproduction fidelity).\n\n## What this build delivers\n1. **Shared infrastructure** (Waves 1â€“6): a deterministic-gate eval harness on the Foreman test substrate\n   (three TAP-emitting validators; advisory cross-family/LLM judging isolated OUT of the gate path); a\n   machine-checkable handoff contract; per-skill repo templates + a swappable logical-tierâ†’model table; the\n   7-field journal schema + a North-Star-gated sleep loop with versioned rollback; Foundry governance wiring.\n2. **Five cognitive skills to a concrete done-floor** (Waves 7â€“12): Gandalf (critical review), Ramanujan\n   (math/algorithm), literature review, data analysis, analytic+ML code, code verification.\n3. **The proof** (Waves 13â€“14): a recreate-a-paper recipe reproducing Gelman ANOVA, graded PASS/FAIL on a\n   deterministic architecture/handoff done-check (NOT reproduction fidelity).\n4. **The self-improving proof** (Wave 15): an inject-defect-then-recover demonstration that a skill measurably\n   improves from its own genuine-execution journal across a sleep cycle.\n\n## Locked design pillars\n- Two-tier repo: append-only journal vs curated SKILL.md; eval-gated, versioned, rollback-able promotion.\n- PRINCIPLE-D: the no-regression GATE is deterministic-only; all LLM/cross-family judging is advisory and\n  isolated from the (terminal) Foreman gate.\n- North-Star anti-drift gate: non-goals are machine-checkable negative canaries; a revision advancing a\n  non-goal is rejected.\n- Persona = method + LOGICAL model tier (a swappable brain seam), so a different brain can be swapped in later.\n- Machine-checkable handoff contract (north-star round-trip + existence-checked paths + block-on-open-questions).\n- recreate-a-paper: required upstream lineage/lit-review + Assumptions Ledger + understandâ†’build firewall +\n  executed numbers BOUND to the verified module + context-isolated advisory grader.\n\n## Out of scope (anti-drift)\nGWL harness / t2rs brain (parallel track); stateful productivity/personal agents (later program phases); the\nextend-own-paper second slice; Jumper/doc-writing/legal/propose-extensions (later portfolio waves).\n\n## Provenance\nForged by researchPrime (ENGINE-verified Phase-0 research) â†’ Crucible (Stage 0 lock â†’ Stage 1 Master Plan v4,\n3 Shark-Tank rounds to convergence â†’ Stage 2). See `crucible/MASTER-PLAN.md`, `CRUCIBLE-INTAKE.md`,\n`research/phase0-run/DELIVERABLE.md`.\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}}}
